# Whitelist the ingested-source library (raw PDFs, scans, WHO guidelines
# etc. committed via scripts/upload-bib-papers.sh and similar intake
# pipelines per AGENTS.md §"library/").
#
# The layout is per-document — library/<doc-id>/<file>.pdf — so these
# patterns must reach INTO a subdirectory. The old single-level
# `!uploads/*.pdf` did not, and a freshly ingested PDF would have been
# silently ignored while the git-mv'd ones stayed tracked (the worst
# kind of half-working). `**` covers both depths.
!library/**/*.pdf
!library/**/*.txt
!library/**/*.json
!library/**/*.html
!library/**/*.xml
!library/**/*.csv
!library/**/*.tsv
!library/**/*.md
